  "_comment": "One prompt for the top of the frame, another for the bottom — sky over landscape, heaven over earth. ConditioningSetArea confines each encoding to its own rectangle before they are combined, which is spatial rather than weighted: unlike a blend, both subjects appear, each where it was put. Areas are halves of the frame; the height values are what to edit for a different horizon.",
